# This folder contains all image assets for the website

## Required Images:

### Logo
- logo.png (40x40px or larger, transparent background recommended)

### Hero Section
- hero-bg.jpg (1920x1080px or larger for full-width background)

### Portfolio/Client Images
- client-1.png (UGRO Capital)
- client-2.png (Luma Fertility)
- client-3.png (AWFIS)
- client-4.png (Luma Fertility App)
- client-5.png (IMWOW)
- client-6.png (Awfis Coworking)

All images should be optimized for web (compressed) to ensure fast loading times.
Recommended dimensions for client images: 800x600px or similar aspect ratio.
